#: data/eog.appdata.xml.in:6 data/org.gnome.eog.desktop.in.in:3
#: src/eog-application.c:338 src/eog-window.c:5544
msgid "Image Viewer"
msgstr "Beeldvertoner"

#: data/eog.appdata.xml.in:7 data/org.gnome.eog.desktop.in.in:4
msgid "Browse and rotate images"
msgstr "Vertoon en roteer beelde"

#: data/eog.appdata.xml.in:9
msgid ""
"Image Viewer is the official image viewer for the GNOME desktop. It "
"integrates with the GTK look and feel of GNOME, and supports many image "
"formats for viewing single images or images in a collection."
msgstr ""
"Beeld Kyker is die amptelike beeldkyker vir die GNOME lessenaar. Dit "
"integreer met die GTK-voorkoms en gevoel van GNOME, en ondersteun baie "
"beeldformate om enkele beelde of beelde in 'n versameling te bekyk."

#: data/eog.appdata.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"Image Viewer also allows to view the images in a fullscreen slideshow mode "
"or set an image as the desktop wallpaper. It reads the camera tags to "
"automatically rotate your images in the correct portrait or landscape "
"orientation."
msgstr ""
"Beeld Kyker laat ook toe om die beelde in 'n volskerm skyfievertoning af te "
"sien modus of stel 'n beeld as die lessenaar plakpapier. Dit lees die kamera "
"tags om jou beelde outomaties in die korrekte portret of landskaporiëntasie "
"te draai."

